# Icon/splash SOURCES, regenerated from ../../brand by make-assets.js. The
# generated Android resources under android/app/src/main/res ARE committed -
# a fresh clone should build the right-looking app without needing the node
# step first - but these 1024/2732px intermediates are pure derivation.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash: unanchored, this also matched
# android/app/src/main/assets/, which is where Capacitor bakes the config
# that decides which URL the app actually loads.
/assets/

